BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga with the 12 Steps of Recovery with Breann
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260715T171500
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260715T181500
UID:3ec20d4bf0531d4fef493abb958159cb@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:The yoga of 12-Step recovery. Combining the practical tools of
  the 12-Step program with the ancient wisdom of yoga. Y12SR is a yoga prac
 tice followed by a brief group discussion based on the 12-steps. Open to e
 veryone and anyone dealing with their own addictive behavior or affected b
 y the addictive behavior of others. This is an open and inclusive group. A
 ll A’s are welcome. Y12SR is NOT a replacement for meetings\, sponsor\, 
 or a part of the 12-step program. Free class provided in partnership with 
 USARA.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:70+ Resistance Band Strength Training
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260716T100000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260716T104500
UID:a0a20978bb109083a829cb7fa5657ec8@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:This 45-minute resistance band strength class is for adults 70
 + who want to build strength\, improve balance\, and stay active in a supp
 ortive\, small-group setting. Classes focus on simple\, low-impact movemen
 ts that support everyday mobility and confidence. Exercises are adaptable 
 and meet participants where they are. Resistance bands are provided or you
 ’re welcome to bring your own. Please wear comfortable clothing\, stable
  shoes\, and bring a water bottle. Thursdays at 10:00 AM at Wellness Colle
 ctive $10 per class To sign up\, text Susette at 435-260-2523. Or show up!
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Community Yoga with Kylie
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260716T171500
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260716T181500
UID:db3269578c3a84547bdc16494b2080ed@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Community based yoga every Thursday night. Mats an
 d props provided. Class suitable for all bodies and skill levels. Class pr
 icing is by donation (recommended $10 per class). Sliding scale pricing av
 ailable options! No one is turned away.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dharma Recovery with Jan
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260716T183000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260716T193000
UID:3c694f220db7e5cf1a592690cbbe7b74@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Tom for Dharma Recovery-a peer-led community space that i
 s unified by our trust in the potential of each of us to recover and find 
 freedom from the suffering of addiction. We believe that the traditional B
 uddhist teachings\, often referred to as the Dharma\, offer a powerful app
 roach to healing from addiction and living a life of true freedom. Class i
 s free.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flow into Friday Yoga with Bre
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260717T083000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260717T093000
UID:278ef72f65a5cac38845bb7d492bad24@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:A gentle and grounding way to move mindfully into your weekend
 . Start your Friday with this all-levels yoga class designed to help you a
 waken the body\, center the mind\, and ease into your day with intention. 
 We’ll begin with slow\, fluid movement to energize and open\, followed b
 y longer-held stretches and restorative postures to help you release tensi
 on and reconnect with yourself. This class is inclusive\, beginner-friendl
 y\, and rooted in breath\, balance\, and compassionate movement. Whether y
 ou’re unwinding from your week or preparing for the weekend ahead\, Frid
 ay Flow is a chance to show up just as you are.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga at USARA with Breann
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260717T100000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260717T104500
UID:b67fecdbc1940356baec0707298c3064@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:An All-Levels Yoga class for USARA participants and all commun
 ity members. A free class held inside at USARA. Mats provided. Location: 2
 3 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Monthly Ayurveda Talk- Ritucharya
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260717T190000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260717T200000
UID:02036661ef464bbb74e926bd5fab07d4@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Kathy for an introduction to Ritucharya\, the Ayurvedic p
 ractice of living in harmony with the changing seasons. Rooted in a holist
 ic system practiced for thousands of years\, Ayurveda recognizes that our 
 environment influences our bodies and minds\, offering practical tools to 
 support balance\, vitality\, and overall well-being throughout the year. I
 n this workshop\, we’ll explore the Ayurvedic perspective on summer and 
 how the qualities of the season can affect energy\, digestion\, mood\, and
  overall health. Together\, we’ll discuss the elements and attributes as
 sociated with summer\, common seasonal imbalances\, and supportive daily p
 ractices that can help cultivate balance during the warmer months. This wo
 rkshop is intended to be educational\, reflective\, and approachable for a
 nyone curious about applying Ayurvedic wisdom to everyday life. No prior e
 xperience with Ayurveda is needed. By Donation – Suggested $15–25
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532\, USA
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Qi-Gong with Cody
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260718T080000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260718T090000
UID:0f6e5dab4431c6cf0d5f936f0dc7993a@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Zhineng Qigong is a powerful mind-body practice rooted in anci
 ent Chinese healing traditions and adapted for modern times. This gentle y
 et profound system blends slow movement\, sound\, visualization\, and medi
 tation to help individuals cultivate inner peace\, restore balance\, and e
 nhance vitality. By consciously connecting with the energy of life—what 
 some may call qi or universal life force—participants are invited into a
  process of holistic healing: physically\, emotionally\, and spiritually. 
 One of the most accessible forms of Qigong\, Zhineng emphasizes connection
  over complexity. Its principles can be embraced by people of all ages\, b
 ackgrounds\, and physical abilities. Cody teaches from a place of lived ex
 perience\, having found this practice deeply healing and transformative in
  his own journey. His classes focus on cultivating shared energy through g
 roup practice\, empowering individuals to tap into their innate wisdom and
  live with greater purpose and presence.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chair Yoga with Breann
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260720T090000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260720T100000
UID:8bb1bd10383c555cebf9f1351e96d648@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Chair Yoga – Mondays at 9 AM Join us every Monday morning at
  9:00 AM for a gentle and accessible Chair Yoga class\, led by Breann\, a 
 certified trauma-sensitive yoga teacher and experienced massage therapist.
  Breann brings over 20 years of experience in guiding others toward greate
 r body awareness\, healing\, and relaxation. This class is designed for ev
 eryone – whether you are new to yoga\, have limited mobility\, or are lo
 oking for a mindful and soothing way to start your week. Chair Yoga allows
  you to experience the benefits of yoga without needing to get down on a m
 at. What to Expect: • Seated and standing postures using the chair for s
 upport • Gentle stretches to enhance flexibility • Breathing exercises
  to calm the mind and body • Movements to promote better circulation and
  balance ✨ No experience necessary – come as you are! Where: Wellness 
 Collective When: Every Monday at 9:00 AM Cost: By donation Let this practi
 ce be a moment of self-care and grounding in your week.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chair Yoga @ the Grand Center-Bre
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260721T143000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260721T153000
UID:3bbc0c9eb4c4ccf27542661ee2a9802d@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Tuesday afternoon at 2:30 PM at the Grand Center
  for a gentle\, accessible Chair Yoga class led by rotating Wellness Colle
 ctive yoga instructors. Each teacher brings their own style and expertise\
 , while sharing a common focus on safety\, choice\, and ease in the body. 
 This class is especially supportive for older adults and anyone who prefer
 s to stay off the floor\, has limited mobility\, uses a chair for stabilit
 y\, or is simply looking for a calm\, nourishing way to move. All poses ar
 e done seated or standing with the support of a chair\, so you can experie
 nce the benefits of yoga without getting down on a mat.
LOCATION:Grand Center\, 182 N 500 W\, Moab\, UT 84532\, USA
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Take Care Tuesday - Relaxing Yoga with Rylin
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260721T171500
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260721T181500
UID:e3d68100e99d7da220628b2ae6f8e65e@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Make space to slow down with Take Care Tuesday\, a weekly rota
 ting class centered around rest and relaxation. Each facilitator brings th
 eir own style and gifts\, offering calming yoga along with special element
 s such as sound baths\, Reiki\, massage\, meditation\, and other restorati
 ve practices. Whether you come to stretch\, settle your nervous system\, o
 r simply enjoy a peaceful evening in community\, each class offers somethi
 ng a little different and supportive. Open to all levels. Come as you are.
  Rest is welcome here.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
